  "message": "Updated FEBasicApplication submodule to the latest version; Bloom, depth of field and chromatic aberration can now be turned on and off per camera, previously FERenderer overwrote state of these effects every frame; Depth of field is now off by default; Uniforms of a post process effect that is turned off are no longer updated; Added FECameraComponent::IsBloomEnabled, SetBloomEnabled, IsDOFEnabled, SetDOFEnabled, IsChromaticAberrationEnabled and SetChromaticAberrationEnabled; Native script module of the free camera controller is rebuilt for new layout of FECameraComponent; Engine version is now 0.3.0.",
